
here in this question we need to return the max diff of the consecutive numbers.
ex- 
N = 6
nums = [20,25,27,33,65,70]

minEle = 20;
maxEle = 70;
gap = (maxEle - minEle)/(N - 1) = 10;

ith bucket
   0th bucket [20,25,27]
   1th bucket [ 33 ]
   2th bucket [ x ]
   3rd bucket [ x ]
